<%@ page contentType="text/html; charset=UTF-8" %><!doctype html><html><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Why Organic | GreenBasket</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="<%=request.getContextPath()%>/assets/css/greenbasket.css"></head><body><%@ include file="/WEB-INF/includes/header.jspf" %><main class="page-shell"><div class="container"><div class="page-head"><span class="eyebrow">Why organic</span><h1 style="margin-top:14px">Better choices begin with better growing practices.</h1><p>GreenBasket is built only for organic products, keeping the marketplace focused and easy to understand.</p></div><div class="feature-grid"><article class="feature-card"><div class="feature-num">🌱</div><h3>Thoughtful farming</h3><p>Organic systems emphasize farming practices that reduce dependence on synthetic inputs and support soil health.</p></article><article class="feature-card"><div class="feature-num">🥕</div><h3>Cleaner discovery</h3><p>Because GreenBasket is organic-only, shoppers do not need to separate conventional and organic listings while browsing.</p></article><article class="feature-card"><div class="feature-num">🤝</div><h3>Local farmer support</h3><p>Buying directly through a farmer-focused marketplace helps create visibility for growers committed to organic practices.</p></article></div><div style="margin-top:22px" class="cta-strip"><div><h2>See what farmers are offering today.</h2><p>Browse GreenBasket's nine focused organic categories.</p></div><a class="btn btn-gold" href="<%=ctx%>/products.jsp">Browse marketplace</a></div></div></main><%@ include file="/WEB-INF/includes/footer.jspf" %></body></html>
